        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Column 2: Navigation Links -->
    <div class="footer-col">
      <h4 class="col-title">NAVEGACIÓN</h4>
      <ul class="col-list">
        <li><a href="/explorar">Explorar</a></li>
        <li><a href="/rutas">Rutas</a></li>
        <li><a href="/momentos">Momentos</a></li>
        <li><a href="/historias">Historias</a></li>
        <li><a href="/sobre-aldo">Sobre Aldo</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <!-- Column 3: Information -->
    <div class="footer-col">
      <h4 class="col-title">INFORMACIÓN</h4>
      <ul class="col-list">
        <li><a href="#como-funciona">¿Cómo funciona?</a></li>
        <li><a href="#faqs">Preguntas frecuentes</a></li>
        <li><a href="#terminos">Términos y condiciones</a></li>
        <li><a href="#privacidad">Privacidad</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <!-- Column 4: Contact -->
    <div class="footer-col">
      <h4 class="col-title">CONTACTO</h4>
      <p class="contact-prompt">¿Tienes una historia o ruta que quieres compartir?</p>
      <a href="mailto:hola@aldoenruta.com" class="contact-email">
        <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><rect x="2" y="4" width="20" height="16" rx="2"/><path d="m22 7-8.97 5.7a1.94 1.94 0 0 1-2.06 0L2 7"/></svg>
        hola@aldoenruta.com
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="footer-bottom">
    <div class="container">
      <p>© 2026 Aldo en Ruta. Todos los derechos reservados.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>

<style>
  .site-footer {
    background: #05080E;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    padding-top: 4rem;
    margin-top: auto;
  }

  .footer-container {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 2fr 1fr 1fr 1.5fr;
    gap: 3rem;
    padding-bottom: 3.5rem;
  }

  .footer-logo {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .logo-icon {
    width: 32px;
    height: 26px;
  }

  .brand-title {
    font-family: var(--font-title);
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text-main);
  }

  .brand-sub {
    display: block;
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }

  .brand-description {
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    color: var(--text-sub);
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    max-width: 320px;
  }

  .social-links {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.85rem;
  }

  .social-icon {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    width: 38px;
    height: 38px;
    border-radius: var(--radius-full);
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    color: var(--text-sub);
    transition: var(--transition-fast);
  }

  .social-icon:hover {
    color: var(--gold-primary);
    border-color: var(--border-gold);
    background: var(--gold-subtle);
  }

  .col-title {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    color: var(--text-main);
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }

  .col-list {
    list-style: none;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }

  .col-list a {
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    color: var(--text-sub);
    transition: color var(--transition-fast);
  }

  .col-list a:hover {
    color: var(--gold-primary);
  }

  .contact-prompt {
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    color: var(--text-sub);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .contact-email {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--gold-primary);
    font-weight: 500;
    transition: opacity var(--transition-fast);
  }

  .contact-email:hover {
    opacity: 0.85;
  }

  .footer-bottom {
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
    padding: 1.5rem 0;
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .footer-container {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 2rem;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .footer-container {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
